### Teste 1 — Sem token (deve retornar 401)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/test

### Teste 2 — Obter token do Keycloak
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/dotnet-case-study/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=gateway-client&client_secret=YIyOjUaPkW22Qe81Ng73vsI34k224YN9&username=testuser&password=123456

### Teste 3 — Com token (substituir <ACCESS_TOKEN> pelo token retornado acima)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/test
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>